---
/* Маніфест: велике твердження і коротке уточнення збоку. */
---

<section class="section">
	<div class="container grid-12 manifesto">
		<p class="text-manifesto manifesto__main">
			6 in 10 calls to small businesses go unanswered. You’re with a client, under a sink or finally off for the night, and the phone rings anyway.
		</p>
		<p class="text-small manifesto__side">
			Voicemail doesn’t book anyone. A call center reads a script and doesn’t know your services, prices or regulars.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.manifesto {
		align-items: end;
		row-gap: var(--space-32);
	}

	.manifesto__main,
	.manifesto__side {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		max-width: none;
	}

	.manifesto__main { text-wrap: balance; }

	@media (min-width: 1024px) {
		.manifesto__main { grid-column: 1 / span 8; }
		.manifesto__side { grid-column: 10 / span 3; }
	}
</style>
